Homepage: https://bitwarden.com
Description: secure and free password manager for all of your devices
 Bitwarden is an open source password manager that stores logins, cards,
 identities, and notes in an end-to-end encrypted vault. Vault data is
 encrypted locally before it is synced, so only you can read it.
 .
 This package provides the bw command-line interface for managing and
 scripting against a Bitwarden vault.
